{
  "name": "october_brain_phase5_202610",
  "description": "NEW_MODEL_INTEGRATION Phase 5 for the October brain candidates on the 3090, one model at a time, with Phase 4.5 settings from the registry (nex-n2.5:mini thinking off; ornith-1.5:35b-a3b and qwen3.8:27b thinking on). Thinking models run reasoning with end-of-text stops only and a thinking-sized output budget, because task stop sequences fire inside thinking text. Code (full EvalPlus) was run in Phase 4 with thinking off and is not repeated. Harness: bench-reasoning extract v4 (flexible BBH/DROP rows, BBH 1024-token budget, newline-Q stop). Order: fastest model first.",
